WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Two bombs are lit beside Ryu after the target-knockdown prerequisite.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.150
Ryu performs the recorded wake-up Drive Reversal.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.600
Kimberly guards the recorded reversal.

4
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.300
Standing medium punch punishes the guarded reversal.

5
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:02.750
A second standing medium punch intentionally whiffs during the bomb conversion.

6
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.150
Heavy-punch teleport follows the automatic first bomb launch.

7
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:03.600
Crouching heavy punch extends the juggle.

8
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.050
Another heavy-punch teleport follows the second bomb.

9
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.800
Crouching heavy punch continues into Sprint launcher.

10
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.100
Heavy bomb plant uses the last spray can.
